(How to assemble:) Tj
T* (1. Print every tile from the poster PDF at 100% \(actual size, no scaling\).) Tj
T* (2. Trim each tile on its outer grid line. Tile names are row-column: tile 1-2 is top row, second from left.) Tj
T* (3. Butt the tiles together on the wall following this map, matching the grid lines.) Tj
T* (4. Peel each vinyl square and stick it on the square with the same letter.) Tj
